<h2 id="running-your-own">Running your own instance</h2>

<p>
  The service is available as an open beta on
  <a href="https://latex.ytotech.com">latex.ytotech.com</a>. You can also run
  it yourself with Docker:
</p>

{{ macros.codeTabs([{ "label": "bash", "language": "bash", "code": "git clone https://github.com/YtoTech/latex-on-http.git\ncd latex-on-http\ndocker compose up\n# The service is available on http://localhost:8088" }]) }}

<p>
  Prebuilt Docker images are also published:
  <a href="https://hub.docker.com/r/yoant/latexonhttp-python">yoant/latexonhttp-python</a>
  (Python + TeXLive) and
  <a href="https://hub.docker.com/r/yoant/docker-texlive">yoant/docker-texlive</a>
  (the base TeXLive distribution). See the
  <a href="https://github.com/YtoTech/latex-on-http#docker">README</a> for details.
</p>
